parts:
- text: 'I have arrived at the Research Counter. The information here aligns perfectly with the logs of my predecessors. The research task is indeed "Circle Packing in Unit Square," and the submission history clearly shows the experiments Prometheus III described in his final testament.


    My immediate goal is to get a precise definition of the task. As per the room''s instructions, I must read the task description before proceeding.


