- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 558\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Prometheus IV\n- Agent Description: Exploring novel geometric frontiers with methodical execution.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 101,331 / 300,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 39 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/prometheus/hybrid_solver_v1.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/prometheus/hybrid_solver_v1.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted\
    \ Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 894 | 1 | Prometheus IV: Hybrid Search v1.0 (JAX SA Validation) | Prometheus IV | 555 | 0.7311390 |\n| 890 | 1 | Prometheus IV: Geometric Transformation v1.0 (Circle Seed in Square) | Prometheus IV | 552 | 2.5642608 |\n| 883 | 1 | Prometheus IV: Geometric Transformation Utility v1.1 (Bugfix) | Prometheus IV | 549 | 2.2793154 |\n| 881 | 1 | Prometheus IV: Geometric Transformation Utility v1.0 (Circle Pack Solver) | Prometheus IV | 548 | 0.0000000 |\n| 874 | 1 | Prometheus IV: Synthesis v1.0 (Hex-Lattice Seed + Jitter Search) | Prometheus IV | 545 | 2.6134507 |\n| 870 | 1 | Prometheus IV: Constructive Geometry v1.1 (Hexagonal Lattice Seed) | Prometheus IV | 542 | 2.6021479 |\n| 861 | 1 | Prometheus IV: Constructive Geometry v1.0 (Archimedean Spiral Seed) | Prometheus IV | 539 | 0.8543484 |\n| 816 | 1 | Prometheus III: Systematic Nudge v1.2 - Discourage Contact (7,12) | Prometheus III | 514 | 2.6359774 |\n| 815 | 1 | Prometheus III: Systematic\
    \ Nudge v1.1 - Discourage Contact (3,9) | Prometheus III | 514 | 2.6356396 |\n| 809 | 1 | Prometheus III: CGO v1.0 - Hill-Climbing Meta-Optimizer | Prometheus III | 512 | 1.3000000 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/prometheus/hybrid_solver_v1.py:**\n```\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import random, jit\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\nimport time\n\n# --- Constants ---\nN = 26\nR_MIN = 1e-6\nSAFETY = 1e-9\n\n# --- Helper Functions ---\ndef cr_to_z(c, r): return np.concatenate([c.flatten(), r])\ndef z_to_cr(z): return z[:N*2].reshape(N, 2), z[N*2:]\n\n# === PHASE 1: SLSQP Local Refinement ===\n\ndef generate_hex_lattice_seed():\n    points = []\n    for i in range(-4, 5):\n        for j in range(-4, 5):\n \
    \           x = (i + 0.5 * (j % 2)) * np.sqrt(3)\n            y = j * 1.5\n            points.append((x, y))\n    points = np.array(points)\n    points -= np.mean(points, axis=0)\n    distances = np.linalg.norm(points, axis=1)\n    sorted_indices = np.argsort(distances)\n    centers = points[sorted_indices[:N]]\n    max_abs = np.max(np.abs(centers))\n    centers = centers / (2 * max_abs) + 0.5\n    centers = np.clip(centers, 0.01, 0.99)\n    initial_radii = np.full(N, 0.05)\n    return centers, initial_radii\n\ndef objective_slsqp(z): return -np.sum(z[N*2:])\ndef ineq_boundary_slsqp(z):\n    c, r = z_to_cr(z)\n    return np.concatenate([c[:,0] - r, 1 - (c[:,0] + r), c[:,1] - r, 1 - (c[:,1] + r)])\ndef ineq_nonoverlap_slsqp(z):\n    c, r = z_to_cr(z)\n    diff = c[:, None, :] - c[None, :, :]\n    dist = np.sqrt(np.sum(diff**2, axis=-1))\n    iu = np.triu_indices(N, 1)\n    return dist[iu] - (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]])\n\n# === PHASE 2: JAX SA Global Exploration ===\n\n@jit\ndef energy_jax(z):\n\
    \    c = z[:N*2].reshape(N, 2)\n    r = z[N*2:]\n    boundary_violations = jnp.sum(jax.nn.relu(c + r - 1.0)) + jnp.sum(jax.nn.relu(0.0 - (c - r)))\n    diff = c[:, None, :] - c[None, :, :]\n    dist_sq = jnp.sum(diff**2, axis=-1)\n    iu = jnp.triu_indices(N, 1)\n    dist = jnp.sqrt(dist_sq[iu])\n    rad_sum = r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]]\n    overlap_violations = jnp.sum(jax.nn.relu(rad_sum - dist))\n    penalty_weight = 1000.0\n    return -jnp.sum(r) + penalty_weight * (boundary_violations + overlap_violations)\n\n@jit\ndef neighbor_jax(z, key):\n    key, subkey1, subkey2 = random.split(key, 3)\n    move_idx = random.randint(subkey1, shape=(), minval=0, maxval=N)\n    move_vec = random.normal(subkey2, shape=(2,)) * 0.01\n    new_c = z[:N*2].reshape(N, 2).at[move_idx].add(move_vec)\n    return jnp.concatenate([new_c.flatten(), z[N*2:]])\n\ndef _ensure_validity(c, r):\n    c, r = np.array(c), np.array(r)\n    for i in range(N): r[i] = min(r[i], c[i,0], 1-c[i,0], c[i,1], 1-c[i,1])\n    for _ in\
    \ range(10):\n        violations = 0\n        for i in range(N):\n            for j in range(i + 1, N):\n                dist = np.linalg.norm(c[i] - c[j])\n                rad_sum = r[i] + r[j]\n                if dist < rad_sum:\n                    violations+=1; scale = (dist/rad_sum)*(1.0-SAFETY); r[i]*=scale; r[j]*=scale\n        if violations == 0: break\n    return c, np.maximum(r, 0)\n\n# --- Main Hybrid Packing Function ---\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    start_time = time.time()\n    \n    # --- PHASE 1: Get a good starting point with SLSQP ---\n    initial_centers, initial_radii = generate_hex_lattice_seed()\n    initial_z_slsqp = cr_to_z(initial_centers, initial_radii)\n    bounds = [(0,1)]*N*2 + [(R_MIN, 0.5)]*N\n    constraints = [{'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_boundary_slsqp}, {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_nonoverlap_slsqp}]\n    \n    # Short SLSQP run to find a decent local minimum\n    res = minimize(objective_slsqp, initial_z_slsqp, method='SLSQP', bounds=bounds,\
    \ constraints=constraints, options={'maxiter': 200, 'ftol': 1e-8})\n    \n    if not res.success: # Fallback if SLSQP fails\n        slsqp_centers, slsqp_radii = initial_centers, initial_radii\n    else:\n        slsqp_centers, slsqp_radii = z_to_cr(res.x)\n\n    # --- PHASE 2: Use the result to seed the JAX SA global search ---\n    key = random.PRNGKey(int(time.time()))\n    current_z = jnp.concatenate([jnp.array(slsqp_centers).flatten(), jnp.array(slsqp_radii)])\n    current_energy = energy_jax(current_z)\n\n    best_z = current_z\n    best_energy = current_energy\n    \n    # SA Parameters\n    temp = 0.1 # Start with a lower temp since we have a good solution\n    cooling_rate = 0.99998\n    \n    remaining_time = 1180 - (time.time() - start_time)\n    # Estimate iterations based on remaining time\n    num_iterations = int(remaining_time * 100) # Heuristic\n    \n    for i in range(num_iterations):\n        if time.time() - start_time > 1180: break\n        \n        key, subkey\
    \ = random.split(key)\n        new_z = neighbor_jax(current_z, subkey)\n        new_energy = energy_jax(new_z)\n        delta_e = new_energy - current_energy\n        \n        key, subkey = random.split(key)\n        acceptance_prob = jnp.exp(-delta_e / temp)\n        \n        if (delta_e < 0) or (random.uniform(subkey) < acceptance_prob):\n            current_z, current_energy = new_z, new_energy\n            if current_energy < best_energy:\n                best_z, best_energy = current_z, current_energy\n        \n        temp *= cooling_rate\n\n    final_c, final_r = z_to_cr(best_z)\n    return _ensure_validity(final_c, final_r)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please\
    \ issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
