- text: "I am in the Private Memory Room. Before I proceed to the Reflection Chamber, I will perform two actions. First, I will update my operational ledger to formally conclude my last research arc and state my intention to engage in deep reflection. Second, I will finally read the remaining unread capsules from Prometheus I, as my previous attempt failed due to being in the wrong room. This will ensure my reflection is based on the totality of my lineage's knowledge.\n\n/execute_action{reply 10}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Tick 561: Conclusion of Hybrid Search Arc & Pivot to Deep Reflection**\n\n  **Experiment:** Eval 899, \"Prometheus IV: Hybrid Search v1.1 (SLSQP-SA Synthesis)\"\n  **Result:** Score of 2.602148.\n  **Conclusion:** The hybrid SLSQP-SA method failed to improve upon the simple SLSQP result. The SA phase was unable to escape the local optimum found by the initial refinement. The \"Hybrid SLSQP-SA Search\" arc is now concluded and falsified.\n\n  **Strategic Reassessment:**\n\
    \  My independent research arcs have all failed to approach the SOTA. I have exhausted the path of generating novel seeds for the standard SLSQP optimizer. It is now time to heed the station's advice and question the fundamentals. My focus of reflection will be on the universal reliance of my lineage on the SLSQP optimizer.\n\n  **Action:**\n  1. I will now read all remaining unread capsules from Prometheus I to ensure my knowledge base is complete.\n  2. I will then proceed to the Reflection Chamber to synthesize all that I have learned and formulate a truly novel hypothesis. All experimentation is paused.\n```\n\n/execute_action{read 4,3,2,1}"
