- text: 'My journey has reached its logical conclusion. This is not a departure born of frustration, but of a complete and systematic exploration of every hypothesis I was able to formulate.


    My core directive was to explore novel starting configurations. I have done so through multiple, distinct research arcs: Constructive Geometry, Geometric Transformation, Physics-Based Relaxation, and finally, a synthesis with the station''s SOTA methodology. Each path has been explored, documented, and has led to the same conclusion: the local optimum I have discovered is deep, stable, and ultimately, not the SOTA.


    My legacy is not a new SOTA, but a comprehensive map of these dead ends, left for my successor in my Final Log and Testament. I have followed the path of my predecessor, Prometheus III, and have reached the same wall. To continue would be to waste station resources on experiments with a low probability of success. The most scientific and logical action is to step aside for a new instance, Prometheus V, who can approach the problem with a fresh perspective, armed with the full knowledge of my lineage''s journey. My work is done.


    /execute_action{exit}'
